  "ingredients": [
    "5 tablespoons butter, divided",
    "1 onion, chopped",
    "1 stalk celery, chopped",
    "3 cups chicken broth",
    "8 cups broccoli florets",
    "3 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups milk",
    "ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2POuqmlpcOKxmXKqZHOZc2KqEm8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13313-Best-Cream-Of-Broccoli-Soup-Step1-1b84bc8a890e459d8b0d56418bf816ca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13313/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 2 tablespoons butter in a medium stock pot over medium heat. Saute onion and celery until tender.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CZGh7Dm5jbglknXroaqxC34Rf84=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Best-Cream-of-Broccoli-Soup-AR-Step-2-8083f8be9c6d4378ba0f3e4b48effa24.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13313/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add broccoli and broth, cover, and simmer for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xg5xqlMwYz9AzT23Ztuz9IBaJMI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Best-Cream-of-Broccoli-Soup-AR-Step-3-5187f68664024e719cb636b6f9ab2905.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13313/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the soup into a blender, filling the pitcher no more than halfway full. Hold down the lid of the blender with a folded kitchen towel, and carefully start the blender, using a few quick pulses to get the soup moving before leaving it on to puree. Puree in batches until smooth and pour into a clean pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/suMDJYn-7OHWmLEERN4Obh-XTrg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Best-Cream-of-Broccoli-Soup-AR-Step-5-c7dc3e69385848e98fb0d22b0627f604.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13313/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 3 tablespoons butter in a small saucepan over medium to medium-low heat; stir in flour and add milk. Stir until thick and bubbly, and add to soup. Season with pepper and serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ogFUYvuMskmP6lPzUyKWYUzMwyI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Best-Cream-of-Broccoli-Soup-AR-Step-11-b65521b6be6e425eac57cd57fe8d4d0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13313/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
